into the 8x8 grid with satisfying precision.\n\nImmersive Environments: Solve puzzles in stunning 360\u00b0 environments, from minimalist zen lofts to breathtaking cosmic vistas designed to help you focus and relax.\n\nExplosive Combo Mechanics: Clear multiple rows and columns to trigger spectacular visual effects and spatial audio cues right in front of your eyes.\n\nInfinite & Adventure Modes: Push your limits in the endless Classic mode or journey through hundreds of unique levels in the Adventure quest.\n\nBrain Training & Relaxation: The perfect blend of mental stimulation and stress relief, built specifically for the VR experience.\n\nAre you ready to shatter your high score in a world without limits?\nDownload now and start blasting!", "short_description": "Block Blast\nExperience the ultimate block puzzle classic, reimagined for immersive VR!"}]}, "developer_name": "DiscoveryMe Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://discoverystudio.online/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://discoverystudio.online/terms-of-use", "publisher_name": "DiscoveryMe Studio", "support_website_url": "https://discoverystudio.online/#contact", "website_url": "https://discoverystudio.online/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26526308153630939"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count"